'at / Sifarish / Hidayat"],["Qudrat wa Hikmat","الْقُدْرَةُ / الْحِكْمَةُ / النِّعْمَةُ / الطَّاقَةُ","Qudrat / Hikmat / Ne'mat / Taaqat"]]}},{"id":"sec_s1l3_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 1 • LESSON 3</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Ma'roof Qur'ani Alfaaz (Set 3 — Ibadat wa Hidayat ke Alfaaz) (Page 18–19)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْقِبْلَةُ ، الشَّفَاعَةُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Qur'ani Alfaaz (Set 3)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْقِبْلَةُ ، الشَّفَاعَةُ ، الْهِدَايَةُ ، الشَّهَادَةُ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الْقِبْلَةُ ، الشَّفَاعَةُ (Qiblah, Shafa'at) → الْقِبْلَةُ ، الشَّفَاعَةُ ، الْهِدَايَةُ ، الشَّهَادَةُ (Qiblah, Sifarish, Hidayat, Gawahi).</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Unit 1 mein aasaan Qur'ani alfaaz aur buniyadi ishaare/qawa'id sikhaye gaye hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 18–19):** Lafz se lafz mil kar qat'ah aur jumla banta hai. Is sabaq ke 36 ma'roof Qur'ani alfaaz (`الْقِبْلَةُ`، `الشَّفَاعَةُ`، `الْأَمَانَةُ`، `الْهِدَايَةُ`، `الطَّاقَةُ`) yaad kar lene se saikdon aayatein aasan ho jati hain."}},{"id":"sec_s1l3_lbl0","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Pichle do asbaaq ki tarah, aap in alfaaz ke maani bhi jaante honge. Nisbatan naye alfaaz ke maani samne likh diye gaye hain:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l3_g1","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s1l3_g1_w1","arabic":"الْقِبْلَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقِبْلَة</span>","hinglish":"Qiblah","translations":{"en":"The Direction of Prayer / Qiblah","ur":"قبلہ","hi":"क़िबला"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w2","arabic":"الظُّلْم","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الظُّلْم</span>","hinglish":"Zulm","translations":{"en":"Injustice / Wrongdoing / Oppression","ur":"ظلم / نا انصافی","hi":"ज़ुल्म / अन्याय"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w3","arabic":"الْإِيْمَان","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِيْمَان</span>","hinglish":"Iman","translations":{"en":"Faith / Belief","ur":"ایمان","hi":"ईमान"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w4","arabic":"السَّرِيع","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّرِيع</span>","hinglish":"Teez/Jaldee karne wala (Swift/Quick)","translations":{"en":"The Swift / Quick","ur":"تیز / جلدی کرنے والا","hi":"तेज़ / जल्दी करने वाला"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w5","arabic":