tion","ur":"جمعہ","hi":"जुमा"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w15","arabic":"الْأَذَان","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْأَذَان</span>","hinglish":"Azan","translations":{"en":"The Call to Prayer / Adhan","ur":"اذان","hi":"अज़ान"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w16","arabic":"الْكُفْر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكُفْر</span>","hinglish":"Kufr/Inkaar (Disbelief)","translations":{"en":"Disbelief","ur":"کفر / انکار","hi":"कुफ़्र / इनकार"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w17","arabic":"الْفِتْنَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْفِتْنَة</span>","hinglish":"Fitnah/Aazmaish","translations":{"en":"Trial / Tribulation / Discord","ur":"فتنہ / آزمائش","hi":"फ़ितना / आज़माइश"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w18","arabic":"الْقَسَم","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقَسَم</span>","hinglish":"Qasam","translations":{"en":"The Oath","ur":"قسم","hi":"क़सम"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w19","arabic":"النِّكَاح","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">النِّكَاح</span>","hinglish":"Nikah","translations":{"en":"Marriage","ur":"نکاح","hi":"निकाह / विवाह"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w20","arabic":"الْقَتْل","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقَتْل</span>","hinglish":"Qatl/Maarna","translations":{"en":"Killing / Murder","ur":"قتل / مارنا","hi":"क़त्ल / मारना"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w21","arabic":"الْخَبَر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْخَبَر</span>","hinglish":"Khabar","translations":{"en":"News / Information","ur":"خبر / اطلاع","hi":"ख़बर / समाचार"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w22","arabic":"الْوَصِيَّة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْوَصِيَّة</span>","hinglish":"Wasiyyat (Will)","translations":{"en":"Bequest / Will / Advice","ur":"وصیت","hi":"वसीयत"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w23","arabic":"الصَّفّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الصَّفّ</span>","hinglish":"Saff/Qataar (Line)","translations":{"en":"The Row / Line / Rank","ur":"صف / قطار","hi":"सफ़ / क़तार"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w24","arabic":"السُّؤَال","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">السُّؤَال</span>","hinglish":"Sawal","translations":{"en":"The Question / Asking","ur":"سوال / پوچھنا","hi":"सवाल / पूछना"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w25","arabic":"النَّفْع","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّفْع</span>","hinglish":"Nafa/Faida (Profit)","translations":{"en":"Benefit / Profit","ur":"نفع / فائدہ","hi":"नफ़ा / फ़ायदा"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w26","arabic":"الْقَبْر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقَبْر</span>","hinglish":"Qabr","translations":{"en":"The Grave","ur":"قبر","hi":"क़ब्र"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w27","arabic":"الشَّفَاعَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشَّفَاعَة</span>","hinglish":"Shafa'at/Sifarish (Intercession)","translations":{"en":"Intercession","ur":"شفاعت / سفارش","hi":"शफ़ाअत / सिफ़ारिश"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w28","arabic":"الْخَلِيفَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْخَلِيفَة</span>","hinglish":"Khalifah/Naib","translations":{"en":"The Successor / Caliph","ur":"خلیفہ / نائب","hi":"ख़लीफ़ा / नायब"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w29","arabic":"التِّلَاوَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">التِّلَاوَة</span>","hinglish":"Tilawat","translations":{"en":"Recitation","ur":"تلاوت","hi":"तिलावत"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w30","arabic":"الْإِحْسَان","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِحْسَان</span>","hinglish":"Ihsaan/Bhalai","translations":{"en":"Excellence / Doing good","ur":"احسان / بھلائی","hi":"एहसान / भलाई"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w31","arabic":"الشَّرِيك","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشَّرِيك</span>","hinglish":"Shareek/Saathi","translations":{"en":"Partner / Associate","ur":"شریک / ساتھی","hi":"शरीक / साथी"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w32","arabic":"الْبَاب","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَاب</span>","hinglish":"Darwaza/Bab","translations":{"en":"The Door / Gate","ur":"دروازہ / باب","hi":"दरवाज़ा / बाब"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w33","arabic":"الْحُبّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحُبّ</span>","hinglish":"Muhabbat/Pyar","translations":{"en":"Love / Affection","ur":"محبت / پیار","hi":"मोहब्बत / प्यार"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w34","arabic":"الْقِتَال","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقِتَال</span>","hinglish":"Qital/Ladai (Fighting/Combat/Battle)","translations":{"en":"Fighting / Warfare","ur":"قتال / لڑائی","hi":"क़िताल / लड़ाई"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w35","arabic":"الْمَتَاع","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَتَاع</span>","hinglish":"Samaan/Mataa (Luggage)","translations":{"en":"Goods / Provision / Enjoyment","ur":"سامان / متاع","hi":"सामान / मताअ"}},{"id":"s1l3_g1_w36","arabic":"الطَّاقَة","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الطَّاقَة</span>","hinglish":"Taaqat/Quwwat (Strength)","translations":{"en":"Capacity / Power / Strength","ur":"طاقت / قوت","hi":"ताक़त / क़ूवत"}}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s1l3_r2","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Lafz se lafz mil kar jumla banta hai. Quran-e-Pak ki aayatein bhi mukhtalif jumle hain. Jis tarah ab aap alfaaz samajhne lage hain, usi tarah In Sha' Allah bohot jald Quran-e-Pak ki aayatein bhi samajhne lagenge.","hinglish_text":"Lafz se lafz mil kar jumla banta hai. Quran-e-Pak ki aayatein bhi mukhtalif jumle hain. Jis tarah ab aap alfaaz samajhne lage hain, usi tarah mein Sha' Allah bohot jald Quran-e-Pak ki aayatein bhi samajhne lagenge."}},{"type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Exercise (Page 19 Q-6): Darj zail Qur'ani aayaat mein se un alfaaz ko pehchaniye jinhein aap mukammal samajhte hain:","title":"Exercise (Page 19 Q-6)"}},{"type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"cols":3,"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s1l3_v_s1","arabic":"﴿وَيَعْلَمُ مَا فِي الْبَرِّ وَالْبَحْرِ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">وَيَعْلَمُ مَا فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَرِّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَحْرِ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Aur woh jaanta hai jo kuch khushki aur samundar mein hai","translations":{"en":"And He knows whatever is in the land and the sea","ur":"اور وہ جانتا ہے جو کچھ خشکی اور سمندر میں ہے","hi":"और वह जानता है जो कुछ ख़ुश्की और समुंदर में है"},"sentence_number":1,"displayOrder":1,"ref":"6:59"},{"id":"s1l3_v_s2","arabic":"﴿إِنَّ الْمُتَّقِينَ فِي جَنَّاتٍ وَنَهَرٍ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمُتَّقِينَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جَنَّاتٍ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">نَهَرٍ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Beshak parhezgar baaghon aur nehar mein honge","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the righteous will be among gardens and rivers","ur":"بیشک متقین باغوں اور نہر میں ہوں گے","hi":"बेशक परहेज़गार बाग़ों और नहर में होंगे"},"sentence_number":2,"displayOrder":2,"ref":"54:54"},{"id":"s1l3_v_s3","arabic":"﴿وَالْفِتْنَةُ أَشَدُّ مِنَ الْقَتْلِ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْفِتْنَةُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">أَشَدُّ مِنَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقَتْلِ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Aur fitnah qatl se zyada sakht hai","translations":{"en":"And fitnah (persecution) is worse than killing","ur":"اور فتنہ قتل سے زیادہ سخت ہے","hi":"और फ़ितना क़त्ल से ज़्यादा सख़्त है"},"sentence_number":3,"displayOrder":3,"ref":"2:191"},{"id":"s1l3_v_s4","arabic":"﴿فَبِظُلْمٍ مِنَ الَّذِينَ هَادُوا﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">فَبِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">ظُلْمٍ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ الَّذِينَ هَادُوا</span>﴾","hinglish":"Toh Yahoodiyon ke zulm ki wajah se","translations":{"en":"So for wrongdoing on the part of the Jews","ur":"پس یہودیوں کے ظلم کی وجہ سے","hi":"तो यहूदियों के ज़ुल्म की वजह से"},"sentence_number":4,"displayOrder":4,"ref":"4:160"},{"id":"s1l3_v_s5","arabic":"﴿وَلَا يَرْضَىٰ لِعِبَادِهِ الْكُفْرَ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">وَلَا يَرْضَىٰ لِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">عِبَادِهِ الْكُفْرَ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Aur woh apne bandon ke liye kufr pasand nahin karta","translations":{"en":"And He does not approve for His servants disbelief","ur":"اور وہ اپنے بندوں کے لیے کفر پسند نہیں کرتا","hi":"और वह अपने बंदों के लिए कुफ़्र पसंद नहीं करता"},"sentence_number":5,"displayOrder":5,"ref":"39:7"},{"id":"s1l3_v_s6","arabic":"﴿وَخُلِقَ الْإِنْسَانُ ضَعِيفًا﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">وَخُلِقَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِنْسَانُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">ضَعِيفًا</span>﴾","hinglish":"Aur insaan kamzor paida kiya gaya hai","translations":{"en":"And mankind was created weak","ur":"اور انسان کمزور پیدا کیا گیا ہے","hi":"और इंसान कमज़ोर पैदा किया गया है"},"sentence_number":6,"displayOrder":6,"ref":"4:28"},{"id":"s1l3_v_s7","arabic":"﴿إِنْ تَرَكَ خَيْرًا الْوَصِيَّةُ لِلْوَالِدَيْنِ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنْ تَرَكَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَيْرًا الْوَصِيَّةُ لِلْوَالِدَيْنِ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Agar woh maal chhore toh walidain ke liye wasiyyat hai","translations":{"en":"If he leaves wealth, a bequest for parents","ur":"اگر وہ مال چھوڑے تو والدین کے لیے وصیت ہے","hi":"अगर वह माल छोड़े तो वालिदैन के लिए वसीयत है"},"sentence_number":7,"displayOrder":7,"ref":"2:180"},{"id":"s1l3_v_s8","arabic":"﴿وَإِنَّهُ لَقَسَمٌ لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عَظِيمٌ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"nonroot\">وَإِنَّهُ لَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">قَسَمٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَظِيمٌ</span>﴾","hinglish":"Aur beshak yeh badi qasam hai agar tum jaano","translations":{"en":"And indeed, it is an oath — if you could know — most great","ur":"اور بیشک یہ بڑی قسم ہے اگر تم جانو","hi":"और बेशक यह बड़ी क़सम है अगर तुम जानो"},"sentence_number":8,"displayOrder":8,"ref":"56:76"},{"id":"s1l3_v_s9","arabic":"﴿الْقِبْلَةَ الَّتِي كُنْتَ عَلَيْهَا﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقِبْلَةَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الَّتِي كُنْتَ عَلَيْهَا</span>﴾","hinglish":"Woh qiblah jis par aap pehle thay","translations":{"en":"The Qiblah which you used to face","ur":"وہ قبلہ جس پر آپ پہلے تھے","hi":"वह क़िब्ला जिस पर आप पहले थे"},"sentence_number":9,"displayOrder":9,"ref":"2:143"}]}}]}}